Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Hi Everyone,

I wanted to understand if there is a way to recover topic data from Kafka
tiered storage after the kafka cluster is deleted . The local data is gone
but the data in tiered storage still exists.

Is there a way to bring up a new kafka cluster and assign the same tiered
storage bucket to it so its able to read data from it by resyncing the
metadata?


Thanks,
Vruttant Mankad

